#: ../../tools/loinc_tools.rst:128 c32a0ea74d904abb9e2437953ffff9e0
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search LOINC (Logical Observation Identifiers Names and "
"Codes) lab tests and clinical observations by name or keywords. Returns "
"standardized codes for laboratory tests, vital signs, and clinical "
"measurements. Essential for standardizing lab test names across "
"healthcare systems and research studies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/loinc_tools.rst:132 aa6caafbd7ce48ab8cbc636087f6f649
msgid ""
"``terms`` (string) (required) Search terms for lab tests or observations "
"(e.g., 'cholesterol', 'blood glucose', 'hemoglobin', 'creatinine'). Can "
"include test names, components, or abbreviations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/loinc_tools.rst:135 37cfa781999c4340b1214f5bb424da5f
msgid ""
"``max_results`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of results to return "
"(default: 20, max: 500)"
